### Battalion Movement Speeds
- Guardian: 9 units per second
- Phreak: 7 units per second
- Breacher: 5 units per second

### Global Update Rules
- State updates on 1-second intervals
- Batch all movement updates
- Synchronize with combat system timer
- Maintain performance during mass movement

## Network Structure
